\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Left: pass@1 rises over 150 steps on all three runs, driven by first drafts (dashed) rather than final answers. \textbf  {Centre: the count of items rescued by turn 2 or later never moves} --- 6--9 out of 540 from step 0 to step 150, across two algorithms and two seeds. Right: the seeded-bug repair channel does improve, confirming the model is learning something about fixing code; it simply never does so \emph  {across turns}. \S  \ref {sec:rl} shows the tool was never successfully called in any of these runs.}}{31}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:training_curves}{{2}{31}{Left: pass@1 rises over 150 steps on all three runs, driven by first drafts (dashed) rather than final answers. \textbf {Centre: the count of items rescued by turn 2 or later never moves} --- 6--9 out of 540 from step 0 to step 150, across two algorithms and two seeds. Right: the seeded-bug repair channel does improve, confirming the model is learning something about fixing code; it simply never does so \emph {across turns}. \S \ref {sec:rl} shows the tool was never successfully called in any of these runs}{figure.caption.10}{}}
